               <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>モードD移行率(※)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/98387</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/67348</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/43580</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/11694</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/9867</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/8310</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <figcaption class=\"left\">(※)小役からの当選など、モードDかどうかを見極められなかったゲーム数は除いてカウントしています</figcaption>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\">サイレントモード移行率、突破率</h3>\n                <p>サイレントモードへの移行率(ガゼ・本前兆を問わず)にも設定差があり、高設定ほど優遇される傾向です。</p>\n                <p>さらに、高確滞在中の弱チェリーやスイカを契機としたサイレントモード移行率は設定差がとりわけ大きいため、複数回見られれば高設定に期待が持てます。</p>\n                <p>設定1.2と設定3以上でAT当選率に差があります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">移行率</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">AT期待度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/349.5</td>\n                            <td>28.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/317.3</td>\n                            <td>28.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/296.7</td>\n                            <td>37.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/249.1</td>\n                            <td>39.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/239.4</td>\n                            <td>39.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/226.7</td>\n                            <td>39.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h4>成立役別のサイレントモード移行率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常滞在時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">スイカ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">弱チェリー</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.2%</td>\n                            <td>0.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">0.4%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">0.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">1.2%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">1.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>高確滞在時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">スイカ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">弱チェリー</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>2.7%</td>\n                            <td>10.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>3.1%</td>\n                            <td>10.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>3.5%</td>\n                            <td>15.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>6.3%</td>\n                            <td>19.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>8.2%</td>\n                            <td>19.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>10.2%</td>\n                            <td>20.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination6\">小役確率</h3>\n                <p>弱チェリーとスイカの出現率に設定差があります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">弱チェリー</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">スイカ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">合算</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/99.9</td>\n                            <td>1/99.9</td>\n                            <td>1/49.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/98.4</td>\n                            <td>1/98.4</td>\n                            <td>1/49.2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/96.9</td>\n                            <td>1/96.9</td>\n                            <td>1/48.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/94.2</td>\n                            <td>1/94.2</td>\n                            <td>1/47.1</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/91.5</td>\n                            <td>1/91.5</td>\n                            <td>1/45.8</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/89.0</td>\n                            <td>1/89.0</td>\n                            <td>1/44.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination7\">レア役成立時の高確移行率</h3>\n                <p>弱チェリーやスイカからの高確移行率には、低設定と高設定とで設定差が設けられています。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">弱チェリー</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 33.3%;\">スイカ</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"3\">25%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"3\">50%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"3\">33.3%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"3\">66.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination8\">超天国時のPVM当選率</h3>\n                <p>超天国中のプレミアムヴェンデッタモード(PVM)当選率は、設定1であっても50%を超えています。</p>\n                <p>なお、高設定ほど突入率が高い模様。</p>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>","shukei":""}